package.description:
High-level Python client for sverk_drone: offboard_control, fmu_control
and optional led_control (LED strip). Requires offboard_interfaces, std_msgs, std_srvs;
for LED API (drone.led) optional: led_interfaces and led_control node.
Camera calibration API (drone.image.calibration) uses camera_calibration services;
QR detection (drone.image.detect_qr) needs the pip package "pyzbar" (+ system libzbar0).
